ad balancer  and apply this policy to the target  now when i go to the load balancing  section under network services  and look into the details of the load  balancer  i see that the security policy has cloud  armor attached to it  let's now try once again to access the  same hello world api without passing any  api key  you'll notice that the error this time  is at a network level from cloud armor  if the same api is accessed with a  header and an invalid api key  then cloud armor is going to clear it  but apogee would do further validation  and block it due to faulty api key that  was just a preview of how to add  multi-layer security for your apis with  apogee and cloud armor  in summary apogee and cloud armor offer  integrated  out of the box security capabilities to  protect your apis  at multiple levels now it's your turn to  try it out  and get started by following the links  in the description box below  [Music]  you
 

